{"ready":true,"data":{"id":"annika-pergament","name":"Annika Pergament","birthDate":"1968-08-30","birthPlace":"","bio":"Annika Pergament is the Senior Business Anchor for NY1 and Time Warner Cable's other newschannels across the United States. In her role, Pergament leads the business news coverage from the New York Stock Exchange.\n\nAs a reporter for NY1 in 1994, Pergament covered politics and later City Hall and the Manhattan beat. In 2001, she joined WCBS-TV as the consumer reporter for the station’s Troubleshooter segment and was a regular contributor to the Early Show. Pergament rejoined NY1 in 2002 as Business Anchor and producer of the Fortune Business Report. From 2002-2009, she also worked as a guest anchor on  Court TV, and later TruTV’s In Session, hosting Newsbreaks and live trial coverage.\n\nShe has also had recurring role as a news anchor on HBO’s The Sopranos and has appeared in Gossip Girl, Wall Street: Money Never Sleeps, Laws of Attraction, Head of State, Maid in Manhattan, Analyze That, and The Yards.","source":"TMDB","fetchedAt":"2026-11-16T12:39:49+00:00","tmdbId":1129795,"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/1129795","credits":[{"id":"punisher-special","title":"The Punisher: One Last Kill","character":"Annika Pergament"}],"photo":"./public-data/images/people/annika-pergament.webp","filmography":[{"name":"The Punisher: One Last Kill","year":2026,"character":"Annika Pergament","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/qQclTgLMDvGBuUBFGHRipxkEwWR.jpg"},{"name":"Daredevil: Born Again","year":2025,"character":"Annika Pergament","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/xDUoAsU8lQHOOoRkFiBuarmACDN.jpg"},{"name":"The Silence","year":2019,"character":"Annika Pergament","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/lTVOquzxw2DPF3MKuYd1ynz9F6H.jpg"},{"name":"A Rainy Day in New York","year":2019,"character":"TV Newscaster","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/z4A6mFOL